          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Tou kere ma Hamath owinjo nike Daudi okengila jolweny pa Hadadeza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "odhiro wode Hadoram m'otho Daudi kodi foyo go gi kikengila Hadadeza; m'oyido Tou olwenyo gine dikweth. Hadoram otero ri Daudi mic kweth ma feza, zahabu, kodi ywel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere Daudi omiyo gigipiny me ma lamo Rwoth kanyacel gi feza, kodi zahabu ma go okwanyo wok i piny je ma go oyido dhumo, Edom, Mowab, Amon, Filistia, kodi Amalek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
